flowchart TD
    S[SensorTask\npriority 2\n2500 ms] -->|xQueueOverwrite SensorData| Q[xSensorQueue]
    Q -->|xQueuePeek| D[DisplayTask\npriority 1\n500 ms]
    Q -->|xQueuePeek| A[AlarmTask\npriority 2\n2500 ms]
    I[InputTask\npriority 3\n5 ms] -->|NavCommand| N[xNavQueue]
    N --> D
    M[MotionTask\npriority 3\n100 ms] -->|bool| MQ[xMotionQueue]
    MQ --> ST[StateTask\npriority 2\n100 ms]
    M -->|set MOTION bit| E{{xSystemEventGroup}}
    ST -->|set/clear ACTIVE bit| E
    A -->|set/clear ALARM bit| E
    E --> D
    E --> ST
    ALL[All diagnostic writers] -->|take/give| MUTEX[xSerialMutex]
    MUTEX --> UART[USART1 serial monitor]
